[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12000.469, "timestamp": "03:20:00", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12003.349, "timestamp": "03:20:03", "text": "内存"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12005.03, "timestamp": "03:20:05", "text": "晚上。它看起来不错是因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12008.229, "timestamp": "03:20:08", "text": "手电筒之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12010.07, "timestamp": "03:20:10", "text": "告诉我，我们能把夜晚变成夜晚。我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12013.67, "timestamp": "03:20:13", "text": "管理员权限。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12026.15, "timestamp": "03:20:26", "text": "这是谁？这是阿拉西尔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12029.42, "timestamp": "03:20:29", "text": "是的，看起来不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12031.11, "timestamp": "03:20:31", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12034.55, "timestamp": "03:20:34", "text": "是的，我们已经有一段时间没见面了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12037.349, "timestamp": "03:20:37", "text": "后退。我记得当时就在这里转圈"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12042.55, "timestamp": "03:20:42", "text": "你当时正在制作这个。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12044.87, "timestamp": "03:20:44", "text": "我不记得我最初的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12049.349, "timestamp": "03:20:49", "text": "很久以前，我们就计划以这个基地为基地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12052.229, "timestamp": "03:20:52", "text": "我只记得当时“还好”。我只记得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12056.71, "timestamp": "03:20:56", "text": "我当时想建一座大城堡，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12059.51, "timestamp": "03:20:59", "text": "一些事情，但我真的真的那些"}]